  '<p class="gd-p">You give the renter the keys only after every check passes. The whole handover is one screen: each part has a green tick once it is done, and the button at the bottom says what is still needed.</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>The job&#39;s header shows how much of the rental walkthrough the renter has read, for example &quot;Renter&#39;s walkthrough: read 2 of 6 steps&quot;. Below 6, walk them through the rest at the car: what to bring, the walk-around, the road rules and the return.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>Finish the handover in the app, to the last step. Until the pickup is recorded the renter&#39;s messages and the office&#39;s records are guesses: 30 minutes after the pickup time you get an alert and a text to record it, or to mark a no-show.</div></aside><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-before-you-start-the-ready-check" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Before you start: the ready check</h2><p class="gd-p">The first part lists what must be done before the car can go: signed, paid, ID checked, deposit. When everything is ready it is one green line; open <b class="gd-ui">The six checks</b> to see them.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Each line should show a green tick: agreement signed, identity verified, coverage confirmed, additional drivers accepted, the booking holds the calendar, deposit taken.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">A red line shows what you can do about it right under it (see the next part). Fix it, then press <b class="gd-ui">Check again</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">All green? Go on down the screen.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Coverage or the calendar not ready? Only the office fixes those: call CarmaCars. Still not ready? Press <b class="gd-ui">Stop: do not release the car</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/410"><img src="/guides/img/field-21-handover-01-ready-phone-ecb54c56.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="410"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91%;top:63.4%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>Never hand over keys if the ready check fails, the renter does not match the photo on file, or they do not have their original licence or the card on file. Stop and call us.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-fix-the-ready-check-on-the-spot" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Fix the ready check on the spot</h2><p class="gd-p">Most red lines are fixed on your phone, without calling the office. Everything you do is recorded with your name.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Agreement not signed: press <b class="gd-ui">Sign now on this device</b> and hand the phone to the renter. A copy signed on paper is not accepted.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Identity not verified: for each driver, press <b class="gd-ui">Take</b> for the licence front, the back and the selfie. Hold the original licence: tick that the name matches, the photo is the person, it is valid past the return and it is class G2 or G. No expiry on file? Type the licence number and the expiry. Press <b class="gd-ui">The licence checks out</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Deposit not taken: press <b class="gd-ui">Card hold: hand this phone to the renter</b>. They type their card in Stripe&#39;s secure form; take the phone back and press <b class="gd-ui">Back to the job</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Paid by e-Transfer instead: open <b class="gd-ui">Paid by e-Transfer</b>, type the reference number from their confirmation and press <b class="gd-ui">Record the e-Transfer</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Paid in cash: open <b class="gd-ui">Paid in cash</b>, count the amount in front of the renter and press <b class="gd-ui">I received</b>. Keep the cash apart from your own money and hand it to CarmaCars within 1 business day, as Finance directs: Finance gets a task to collect it from you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Additional driver not accepted: press <b class="gd-ui">Sign now on this device (additional driver)</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>An expired licence, a face that does not match or a renter who will not sign: do not fix it. Press Stop and call us.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-the-handover-on-one-screen" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The handover, on one screen</h2><p class="gd-p">With the car already? On the job, <b class="gd-ui">Start the check-in now</b> acknowledges, starts and opens the screen in one tap.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Renter, licence and card</b>: three taps. This is the renter named on the booking; you checked the original licence (name, photo, not expired; a photo of a licence is not enough); you saw the physical card with the same last four digits. Something is wrong? Open <b class="gd-ui">Something is wrong</b> and press what it is: the handover stops and the office is told.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Odometer, fuel and keys</b>: already filled in when the car reports them (from the Tracker, else from its last report). Check each against the dash and change what differs. Fuel: tap the level on the gauge, in eighths from E to F. Keys: <b class="gd-ui">+</b> and <b class="gd-ui">−</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Photos</b>: 19 photos, one tap each. <b class="gd-ui">Take this photo</b> always shows the next angle; <b class="gd-ui">All 19 photos</b> lists them, with <b class="gd-ui">Retake</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Damage</b>: nothing new? Leave it. New damage: open it, tap the car diagram where it is, choose Where and Type, press <b class="gd-ui">Add the damage</b> and take the close-up.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Tracker</b>: one green line when it reports. If not, <b class="gd-ui">Check again</b>. The car has to go anyway? Open <b class="gd-ui">The car has to go anyway?</b>, say why and press <b class="gd-ui">Release without the tracker</b>: an Admin is told at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Review and sign</b>: the renter reads the summary and signs, then you. <b class="gd-ui">Use this signature</b> for each.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Hand over the keys</b>. You see &quot;Checked in. The rental has started.&quot; The renter gets the photo report by email and in their Documents.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Not everything in yet? The button above it says what is next (for example &quot;Next: Odometer&quot;) and takes you there. A note for Fleet (anything missing or not clean) is under <b class="gd-ui">Add a note for Fleet</b>.</p><div class="gd-figblock"><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/gui